 "channel": "final", "content": {"content_type": "text", "parts": ["Exactly. That’s the signal you want him to pick up without you overselling it.\n\nThe core impression should be:\n\n**“Peter can already sit in the Principal Consultant chair today, and he has an emerging AI/automation skillset that could become strategically valuable to the practice.”**\n\nThat’s much stronger than pitching yourself as “the AI guy.” The Principal Consultant capability de-risks the hire. The AI layer creates upside.\n\nFor Andrew, that means you look like someone who can help immediately with:\n**scope, requirements, delivery, architecture judgment, manufacturing complexity, stakeholder management, and implementation lifecycle ownership** — while also having a forward-looking capability around AI-enabled ERP that most senior consultants probably do not have yet.\n\nThat’s the kind of profile a director remembers after the interview. memcite"]}, "create_time": 1789364727.851562, "end_turn": true, "id": "166a2d66-daa9-41e9-865a-bb5a88b60362", "metadata": {"can_save": true, "citations": [], "content_references": [{"alt": null, "end_idx": 860, "invalid": false, "matched_text": "memcite", "prefix": null, "prompt_text": null, "refs": [], "safe_urls": [], "start_idx": 851, "type": "hidden"}], "conversation_followup_suggestions_eligible": true, "cot_version": "v5", "default_model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "finish_details": {"stop_tokens": [200002], "type": "stop"}, "is_complete": true, "message_type": "next", "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "model_switcher_deny": [], "parent_id": "5f8a7741-3d6f-46ca-a010-fd1d373d0bcc", "request_id": "6a68d27a-7f0a-4d68-9028-6476498b8155", "resolved_model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "search_result_groups": [], "story_events": [], "thinking_effort": "standard", "turn_exchange_id": "2e580854-effd-4743-933e-9167e69e21aa", "turn_id": "12762ad0-cfa7-4cf6-bbd0-41abb332ea3a", "working_turn_id": "2e580854-effd-4743-933e-9167e69e21aa"}, "recipient": "all", "sta